{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_9DA175B5","title":"Oh This View Was for Me","entry":"Dlg_9DA175B5::entry","exit":"Dlg_9DA175B5::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_466D85A1","articyId":"72057778721536074","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Oh, you found me. This view was one of my favorites.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, you found me. This view was one of my favorites.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":150.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46251","byteOffset":31828800,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_50FDE8AD","articyId":"72057778721536114","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"I would prefer that actually. Solitary in our solidarity.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I would prefer that actually. Solitary in our solidarity.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42183","byteOffset":30286480,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FA702526","articyId":"72057778721536120","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"No, it's ok. If anyone were to find me I'm glad it's you.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, it's ok. If anyone were to find me I'm glad it's you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51601","byteOffset":33937832,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_76E24B4A","articyId":"72057778721536136","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"At any given time there are a number of people looking for a number of things. Some of them other people.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"At any given time there are a number of people looking for a number of things. Some of them other people.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48158","byteOffset":32555384,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_E9AE8E9B","articyId":"72057778721536143","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Because if you look at things in the past tense it means you've appreciated them. If I were to say, this is my favorite view, it would leave it open to the possibility of being disappointed when something else surpasses it.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because if you look at things in the past tense it means you've appreciated them. If I were to say, this is my favorite view, it would leave it open to the possibility of being disappointed when something else surpasses it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33354","byteOffset":20502928,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_B7B79D40","articyId":"72057778721536157","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Exactly. Because at that period of time it was in fact the best view.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Exactly. Because at that period of time it was in fact the best view.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20279","byteOffset":15556624,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_AFC31F0A","articyId":"72057778721536178","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"That's me! And I love it but sometimes I need some me time, you know?","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's me! And I love it but sometimes I need some me time, you know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21778","byteOffset":16128968,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_DA47FFED","articyId":"72057778721536194","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Thank you. Remember to stop and enjoy the view every once and awhile.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thank you. Remember to stop and enjoy the view every once and awhile.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18770","byteOffset":14987480,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_8A68910C","articyId":"72057778721536212","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"This is one of the better views in Nivalis, wouldn't you say?","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is one of the better views in Nivalis, wouldn't you say?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17352","byteOffset":14453360,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_A2F10183","articyId":"72057778721536234","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Yeah, that's what I figured you'd say. If you don't mind I have some time to kill and I'd like to do it by myself.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, that's what I figured you'd say. If you don't mind I have some time to kill and I'd like to do it by myself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28021","byteOffset":18482048,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_E2E98B72","articyId":"72057778721536249","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Maybe we could just stand here and enjoy it for a few?","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe we could just stand here and enjoy it for a few?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24750","byteOffset":17243144,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_33730F76","articyId":"72057778721536263","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zee Burke","text":"Thank you. This has been... this is good conversation to relax my mind with.","speakerId":"Ntt_AF7427FD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thank you. This has been... this is good conversation to relax my mind with.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51861","byteOffset":34035784,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_58936247","articyId":"72057778721536087","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why do you say was?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localiza